  "description": "Experience Freedom with the Caddy Pro Urban Cruiser\n\nTransform your outdoor adventures with the Caddy Pro Urban Cruiser, America’s go-to electric trike! Designed for family fun, this innovative trike features a rear bench seat, allowing you to invite your kids along on every ride. Imagine weaving through parks or cruising down bike paths, all while making unforgettable memories with your little ones.\n\nThis robust electric trike is built with a step-through frame, ensuring effortless mounting and dismounting. The cutting-edge hydraulic disc brakes guarantee powerful stopping capabilities and safety on any terrain, while the fat-tire design provides stability and comfort on rugged paths. With ample front and rear storage, the Caddy Pro is perfect for running errands or enjoying a leisurely ride.\n\nKey Highlights:\n\nRear bench seat for family adventures.\n\nHydraulic disc brakes for superior stopping power.\n\nAll-terrain fat tires for a smooth ride.\n\nAmple storage space for your essentials.\n\nAdjustable front suspension for added comfort.\n\nDon’t miss out on the opportunity to elevate your lifestyle. Choose the Caddy Pro Urban Cruiser today and embrace the joy of riding with your whole family!\n\nBuilt in headlight\n\nThe ultra bright LED headlight is powered by the main battery and controlled at your fingertips.",
